  "prefLabel": "Pdab 201.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 201.01 Purpose and Scope.\n\n(a) This chapter sets forth the rules of practice and procedure for the prescription drug affordability board.\n\n(b) The rules in this chapter shall govern all proceedings before the prescription drug affordability board.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pdab100-300.html"
